{"code":"hi","name":"Hindi","native":"हिन्दी","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"A2","level":{"title":"Elementary: past, future, postpositions, food","goals":["Talk about past and future correctly","Use को/से/का/में/पर in places","Order food and shop with prices"],"units":[{"id":"A2-U1","title":"Past and future","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U1-L1","title":"Past: खाया/खाई","learn":"Past agrees GENDER! Boy: खाया (ate), girl: खाई! वह गया (he went), वह गई (she went). था/थी = was: मैं खुश था (I was happy — boy)! And कल = yesterday AND tomorrow — tense decides!","vocab":[{"t":"कल","r":"kal","en":"yesterday / tomorrow","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"आज","r":"āj","en":"today","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"सुबह","r":"subah","en":"morning","pos":"noun"},{"t":"शाम","r":"shām","en":"evening","pos":"noun"},{"t":"रात","r":"rāt","en":"night (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"फिर","r":"phir","en":"then / again","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"पहले","r":"pahle","en":"before / first","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"बाद में","r":"bād men","en":"later","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Root + या/यी · था/थी","explain":"खा→खाया (m), खा→खाई (f). गया/गई (went), पढ़ा/पढ़ी (read). था (was-m), थी (was-f): वह खुश थी (she was happy)!","pattern":"या (m) · यी (f) · था/थी","examples":[{"t":"मैंने खाना खाया।","r":"mainne khānā khāyā.","en":"I ate food. (boy)"},{"t":"वह गई।","r":"vah gaī.","en":"She went."},{"t":"कल मैं खुश था।","r":"kal main khush thā.","en":"Yesterday I was happy. (boy)"}],"mistakes":["Girls saying खाया — girls say खाई!","Saying कल गया for tomorrow — कल + past = yesterday, कल + future = tomorrow!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"राहुल","t":"कल तुमने क्या किया?","r":"kal tumne kyā kiyā?","en":"What did you do yesterday? (casual)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैंने पढ़ाई की, फिर खेली।","r":"mainne paṛhāī kī, phir khelī.","en":"I studied, then played. (girl)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मैंने काम किया।","r":"mainne kām kiyā.","en":"I worked. (boy)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"बहुत अच्छा!","r":"bahut achchhā!","en":"Very good!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: She went","answer":"वह गई"},{"type":"fill","q":"मैंने खाना ___। (ate, boy)","answer":"खाया"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Yesterday I was happy (boy)' is…","options":["कल मैं खुश हूँ","कल मैं खुश था","कल मैं खुश थी","कल मैं खुश हो"],"answer":"कल मैं खुश था"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: गई / वह","answer":"वह गई"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: वह गई।","answer":"वह गई।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"खाई is spoken by…","options":["boys","girls","elders","everyone"],"answer":1,"why":"-यी = feminine."},{"q":"थी means…","options":["is (f)","was (f)","will be","were (m)"],"answer":1,"why":"थी = was-f."},{"q":"कल means…","options":["today","yesterday / tomorrow","tonight","now"],"answer":1,"why":"कल = both! Tense decides."},{"q":"मैंने signals…","options":["present","past with ने","future","command"],"answer":1,"why":"ने = past-transitive marker."},{"q":"फिर means…","options":["before","then / again","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"फिर = then/again."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Past tense worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["yesterday / tomorrow","then","before"],"key":["कल","फिर","पहले"]},{"instruction":"Agree gender.","items":["I ate (boy)","She went","I was happy (girl)"],"key":["मैंने खाना खाया","वह गई","मैं खुश थी"]},{"instruction":"Talk yesterday.","items":["What did you do yesterday? (casual)","Very good!"],"key":["कल तुमने क्या किया","बहुत अच्छा"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U1-L2","title":"Future: खाऊँगा/खाएगा","learn":"Future sings -गा! मैं खाऊँगा (I will eat — boy), मैं खाऊँगी (girl), वह खाएगा (he will eat), आप खाएँगे (you will eat)! कल + future = tomorrow!","vocab":[{"t":"जल्द","r":"jald","en":"soon","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"एक घंटे में","r":"ek ghanṭe men","en":"in an hour","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"अगले हफ़्ते","r":"agle hafte","en":"next week","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"सोमवार को","r":"somvār ko","en":"on Monday","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"हमेशा","r":"hameshā","en":"always","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"कभी-कभी","r":"kabhī-kabhī","en":"sometimes","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"कभी नहीं","r":"kabhī nahīṅ","en":"never","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"फिर मिलेंगे","r":"phir milenge","en":"see you again","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"-ऊँगा/-एगा/-एगी/-एँगे","explain":"मैं खाऊँगा (m), मैं खाऊँगी (f), वह खाएगा (m), वह खाएगी (f), हम खाएँगे (we will eat)! Root + vowel + गा/गी!","pattern":"ऊँगा/एगा (m) · ऊँगी/एगी (f)","examples":[{"t":"मैं हिन्दी सीखूँगा।","r":"main Hindī sīkhūṅgā.","en":"I will learn Hindi. (boy)"},{"t":"हम बोलेंगे!","r":"ham bolenge!","en":"We will speak!"},{"t":"वह खाएगी।","r":"vah khāegī.","en":"She will eat."}],"mistakes":["Boys saying खाऊँगी — boys: खाऊँगा!","Saying हम खाएगा — हम takes खाएँगे!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"कल तुम क्या करोगे?","r":"kal tum kyā karoge?","en":"What will you do tomorrow? (to boy)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मैं हिन्दी सीखूँगा। और तुम?","r":"main Hindī sīkhūṅgā. aur tum?","en":"I will learn Hindi. And you?"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैं काम करूँगी, फिर खेलूँगी।","r":"main kām karūṅgī, phir khelūṅgī.","en":"I will work, then play. (girl)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"फिर मिलेंगे!","r":"phir milenge!","en":"See you again!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (boy): I will learn Hindi","answer":"मैं हिन्दी सीखूँगा"},{"type":"fill","q":"हम ___! (will speak)","answer":"बोलेंगे"},{"type":"choose","q":"'She will eat' is…","options":["वह खाएगा","वह खाएगी","वह खाऊँगी","वह खाती है"],"answer":"वह खाएगी"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: सीखूँगा / हिन्दी / मैं","answer":"मैं हिन्दी सीखूँगा"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मैं हिन्दी सीखूँगा।","answer":"मैं हिन्दी सीखूँगा।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"खाऊँगा means…","options":["I eat","I will eat (boy)","I ate","I can eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-ऊँगा = future-I-m."},{"q":"खाएगी means…","options":["he will eat","she will eat","I will eat","they will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"-एगी = future-she."},{"q":"जल्द means…","options":["later","soon","never","always"],"answer":1,"why":"जल्द = soon."},{"q":"कभी नहीं means…","options":["sometimes","always","never","soon"],"answer":2,"why":"कभी नहीं = never."},{"q":"हम takes…","options":["-एगा","-एँगे","-ऊँगा","-एगी"],"answer":1,"why":"हम + एँगे."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Future worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["soon","always","never"],"key":["जल्द","हमेशा","कभी नहीं"]},{"instruction":"Make futures.","items":["I will learn (boy)","She will eat","We will speak"],"key":["मैं सीखूँगा","वह खाएगी","हम बोलेंगे"]},{"instruction":"Plan tomorrow.","items":["What will you do tomorrow? (casual)","See you again!"],"key":["कल तुम क्या करोगे","फिर मिलेंगे"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U2","title":"Postpositions","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U2-L1","title":"को/से/का + मुझे","learn":"Hindi's glue words come AFTER! को (to), से (from/with), का/की/के (of — agrees!): मेरा घर (my house), मेरी किताब (my book)! मुझे = to-me: मुझे पानी चाहिए (I need water)!","vocab":[{"t":"शहर","r":"shahar","en":"city (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"सड़क","r":"saṛak","en":"street (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"दुकान","r":"dukān","en":"shop (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"काम","r":"kām","en":"work (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"पार्क","r":"pārk","en":"park (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"संग्रहालय","r":"sangrahālay","en":"museum (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"स्टेशन","r":"sṭeshan","en":"station (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"मुझे","r":"mujhe","en":"to me","pos":"pronoun"}],"grammar":{"title":"को · से · का/की/के","explain":"मुझको = मुझे (to me)! घर को (to the house), घर से (from home), घर का (of the house). का (m), की (f), के (m-pl)!","pattern":"X + को/से/का · मुझे/तुम्हें","examples":[{"t":"मैं स्कूल जाता हूँ।","r":"main skūl jātā hūṅ.","en":"I go to school. (boy)"},{"t":"मुझे पानी चाहिए।","r":"mujhe pānī chāhie.","en":"I need water."},{"t":"यह मेरी किताब है।","r":"yah merī kitāb hai.","en":"This is my book."}],"mistakes":["Saying मेरा किताब — किताब (f): मेरी!","Saying मैंको — to-me is मुझे!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"तुम कहाँ जाते हो?","r":"tum kahāṅ jāte ho?","en":"Where do you go? (casual)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मैं स्कूल जाता हूँ। और तुम?","r":"main skūl jātā hūṅ. aur tum?","en":"I go to school. And you? (boy)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैं दुकान जाती हूँ।","r":"main dukān jātī hūṅ.","en":"I go to the shop. (girl)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"अच्छा!","r":"achchhā!","en":"Nice!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I need water","answer":"मुझे पानी चाहिए"},{"type":"fill","q":"यह ___ किताब है। (my, f)","answer":"मेरी"},{"type":"choose","q":"'To me' is…","options":["मैंको","मुझको","मुझे","मेराको"],"answer":"मुझे"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: चाहिए / पानी / मुझे","answer":"मुझे पानी चाहिए"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मुझे पानी चाहिए।","answer":"मुझे पानी चाहिए।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"मेरी किताब uses मेरी because…","options":["plural","किताब is feminine","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"की agrees with feminine."},{"q":"मुझे means…","options":["I","to me","my","with me"],"answer":1,"why":"मुझ + को = मुझे."},{"q":"से means…","options":["to","from / with","of","in"],"answer":1,"why":"से = from/with."},{"q":"घर का uses का because…","options":["plural","घर is masculine","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"का agrees with masculine."},{"q":"तुम्हें means…","options":["you","to you (casual)","your","with you"],"answer":1,"why":"तुम्ह + को = तुम्हें."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Postpositions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["city","shop","to me"],"key":["शहर","दुकान","मुझे"]},{"instruction":"का/की + मुझे.","items":["This is my book","I need water","I go to school (boy)"],"key":["यह मेरी किताब है","मुझे पानी चाहिए","मैं स्कूल जाता हूँ"]},{"instruction":"Going places.","items":["Where do you go? (casual)","I go to the shop (girl)"],"key":["तुम कहाँ जाते हो","मैं दुकान जाती हूँ"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U2-L2","title":"में/पर + कहाँ/किधर","learn":"BEING vs GOING! में (in), पर (on). कहाँ? = where (being), किधर? = which way (going)! मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ (I live in Delhi). स्कूल किधर है? = Which way is school?","vocab":[{"t":"दिल्ली","r":"Dillī","en":"Delhi","pos":"noun"},{"t":"भारत","r":"Bhārat","en":"India","pos":"noun"},{"t":"दफ़्तर","r":"daftar","en":"office (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"मेज़","r":"mez","en":"table (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"पाठ","r":"pāṭh","en":"lesson (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"पार्टी","r":"pārṭī","en":"party (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"सिनेमा","r":"sinemā","en":"cinema (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"घर","r":"ghar","en":"house","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"में/पर · कहाँ/किधर","explain":"मैं घर में हूँ (I'm at home), किताब मेज़ पर है (book is on the table). कहाँ रहते हो? (where do you live?), किधर जा रहे हो? (which way going?)!","pattern":"में (in) · पर (on) · कहाँ/किधर","examples":[{"t":"मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ।","r":"main Dillī men rahtā hūṅ.","en":"I live in Delhi. (boy)"},{"t":"किताब मेज़ पर है।","r":"kitāb mez par hai.","en":"The book is on the table."},{"t":"स्कूल किधर है?","r":"skūl kidhar hai?","en":"Which way is the school?"}],"mistakes":["Saying में for ON — on = पर!","Saying कहाँ for directions — ways: किधर!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"राहुल","t":"तुम कहाँ रहते हो?","r":"tum kahāṅ rahte ho?","en":"Where do you live? (casual)"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मैं दिल्ली में रहती हूँ। और तुम?","r":"main Dillī men rahtī hūṅ. aur tum?","en":"I live in Delhi. And you? (girl)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मैं भी दिल्ली में!","r":"main bhī Dillī men!","en":"Me too, in Delhi!"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"बहुत बढ़िया!","r":"bahut baṛhiyā!","en":"Excellent!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (boy): I live in Delhi","answer":"मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ"},{"type":"fill","q":"किताब मेज़ ___ है। (on)","answer":"पर"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Which way is the school?' is…","options":["स्कूल कहाँ है","स्कूल किधर है","स्कूल कैसा है","स्कूल क्या है"],"answer":"स्कूल किधर है"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: रहता हूँ / दिल्ली में / मैं","answer":"मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ।","answer":"मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"में means…","options":["on","in","to","from"],"answer":1,"why":"में = in."},{"q":"किधर asks…","options":["where-being","which-way","when","why"],"answer":1,"why":"किधर = which direction."},{"q":"मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ uses रहता because…","options":["plural","boy speaking","formal","past"],"answer":1,"why":"-ता = masculine speaker."},{"q":"भारत means…","options":["Delhi","India","city","home"],"answer":1,"why":"भारत = India."},{"q":"मेज़ is…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural","verb"],"answer":1,"why":"मेज़ = feminine."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"में/पर worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["Delhi","table","house"],"key":["दिल्ली","मेज़","घर"]},{"instruction":"में/पर/किधर.","items":["I live in Delhi (boy)","The book is on the table","Which way is the school?"],"key":["मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ","किताब मेज़ पर है","स्कूल किधर है"]},{"instruction":"Where?","items":["Where do you live? (casual)","Excellent!"],"key":["तुम कहाँ रहते हो","बहुत बढ़िया"]}]}}]},{"id":"A2-U3","title":"Food and shopping","lessons":[{"id":"A2-U3-L1","title":"पसंद and चाहिए","learn":"LIKES flip! मुझे चाय पसंद है = To-me tea is pleasing = I like tea. NEEDS too: मुझे पानी चाहिए = I need water. The THING decides है/हैं: मुझे किताबें पसंद हैं!","vocab":[{"t":"रोटी","r":"roṭī","en":"bread (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"दूध","r":"dūdh","en":"milk (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"पनीर","r":"panīr","en":"cheese (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"सब्ज़ी","r":"sabzī","en":"vegetables (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"मछली","r":"machhlī","en":"fish (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"सेब","r":"seb","en":"apple (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"चाय","r":"chāy","en":"tea (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"कॉफ़ी","r":"kåfī","en":"coffee (f)","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"मुझे X पसंद है · मुझे X चाहिए","explain":"मुझे चाय पसंद है (I like tea), मुझे पानी चाहिए (I need water). Plural things: मुझे किताबें पसंद हैं!","pattern":"मुझे + thing + पसंद है/चाहिए","examples":[{"t":"मुझे पनीर पसंद है।","r":"mujhe panīr pasand hai.","en":"I like cheese."},{"t":"मुझे चाय चाहिए!","r":"mujhe chāy chāhie!","en":"I need tea!"},{"t":"मुझे किताबें पसंद हैं।","r":"mujhe kitāben pasand hain.","en":"I like books."}],"mistakes":["Saying मैं पसंद हूँ — likes: मुझे…पसंद है!","Saying मुझे किताबें पसंद है — plural: पसंद हैं!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"तुम्हें क्या पसंद है?","r":"tumhen kyā pasand hai?","en":"What do you like? (casual)"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मुझे पनीर और रोटी पसंद है!","r":"mujhe panīr aur roṭī pasand hai!","en":"I like cheese and bread!"},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"मुझे मछली पसंद है। मुझे चाय चाहिए!","r":"mujhe machhlī pasand hai. mujhe chāy chāhie!","en":"I like fish. I need tea!"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"मुझे भी कॉफ़ी चाहिए!","r":"mujhe bhī kåfī chāhie!","en":"I need coffee too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I like cheese","answer":"मुझे पनीर पसंद है"},{"type":"fill","q":"मुझे चाय ___! (need)","answer":"चाहिए"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I like books' is…","options":["मैं किताबें पसंद हूँ","मुझे किताबें पसंद हैं","मुझे किताबें पसंद है","मैं किताबों को पसंद"],"answer":"मुझे किताबें पसंद हैं"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: है / पसंद / पनीर / मुझे","answer":"मुझे पनीर पसंद है"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मुझे पनीर पसंद है।","answer":"मुझे पनीर पसंद है।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"मुझे चाय पसंद है means…","options":["I want tea","I like tea","I drink tea","I see tea"],"answer":1,"why":"To-me pleasing = I like."},{"q":"चाहिए means…","options":["like","need / want","eat","drink"],"answer":1,"why":"चाहिए = need."},{"q":"पनीर means…","options":["milk","cheese","butter","curd"],"answer":1,"why":"पनीर = Indian cheese."},{"q":"Plural things take…","options":["पसंद है","पसंद हैं","पसंद हूँ","पसंद हो"],"answer":1,"why":"किताबें → पसंद हैं."},{"q":"The SUBJECT of पसंद है is…","options":["the person","the thing liked","nobody","always मैं"],"answer":1,"why":"Tea pleases me!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"पसंद worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Hindi.","items":["cheese","fish","tea"],"key":["पनीर","मछली","चाय"]},{"instruction":"Like and need.","items":["I like cheese","I like books","I need tea"],"key":["मुझे पनीर पसंद है","मुझे किताबें पसंद हैं","मुझे चाय चाहिए"]},{"instruction":"Ask tastes.","items":["What do you like? (casual)","I need coffee too!"],"key":["तुम्हें क्या पसंद है","मुझे भी कॉफ़ी चाहिए"]}]}},{"id":"A2-U3-L2","title":"Shopping: कितने का","learn":"Shop in Hindi! कितने का है? (How much?), महँगा (expensive), सस्ता (cheap). Money: रुपया (rupee). मैं लेता हूँ = I'll take it (boy)!","vocab":[{"t":"कीमत","r":"qīmat","en":"price (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"पैसे","r":"paise","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"रुपया","r":"rupayā","en":"rupee (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"रसीद","r":"rasīd","en":"receipt (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"छूट","r":"chhūṭ","en":"discount (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"महँगा","r":"mahṅgā","en":"expensive","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"सस्ता","r":"sastā","en":"cheap","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"मुफ़्त","r":"muft","en":"free","pos":"adjective"}],"grammar":{"title":"कितने का है? + मैं लेता हूँ","explain":"रोटी कितने की है? (how much is the bread — f: की!). सौ रुपये (100 rupees). मैं लेता हूँ = I'll take it (boy), मैं लेती हूँ (girl)!","pattern":"कितने का/की है? · मैं लेता/लेती हूँ","examples":[{"t":"रोटी कितने की है?","r":"roṭī kitne kī hai?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"t":"सौ रुपये।","r":"sau rupaye.","en":"100 rupees."},{"t":"मैं लेती हूँ!","r":"main letī hūṅ!","en":"I'll take it! (girl)"}],"mistakes":["Saying रोटी कितने का — रोटी (f): कितने की!","Girls saying लेता हूँ — girls: लेती हूँ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"रोटी कितने की है?","r":"roṭī kitne kī hai?","en":"How much is the bread?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"सौ रुपये।","r":"sau rupaye.","en":"100 rupees."},{"sp":"प्रिया","t":"महँगा है! पनीर कितने का है?","r":"mahṅgā hai! panīr kitne kā hai?","en":"It's expensive! How much is the cheese?"},{"sp":"राहुल","t":"सस्ता है! मैं लेता हूँ!","r":"sastā hai! main letā hūṅ!","en":"It's cheap! I'll take it! (boy)"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How much is the bread?","answer":"रो