ा हूँ / दिल्ली में / मैं","answer":"मैं दिल्ली में रहता हूँ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: मुझे पनीर पसंद है।","answer":"मुझे पनीर पसंद है।"},{"type":"fill","q":"रोटी कितने ___ है? (of, f)","answer":"की"},{"type":"choose","q":"वह खाएगी।","options":["He will eat","She will eat","I will eat","They will eat"],"answer":"She will eat"}]}}}